message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "XGBoost Return Ranking vs Traditional Factors for Adaptive Multi-Asset Portfolio Construction"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-28"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Tabasi
    given-names: Hossein
keywords:
  - xgboost
  - return ranking
  - multi-asset portfolio
  - walk-forward
  - transaction costs
  - momentum
  - mean-variance
abstract: >
  Walk-forward comparison of an XGBoost next-month return ranker against
  equal-weight, simple momentum, and historical mean-variance portfolios
  on a mixed equity, bond, gold, and crypto universe, after one-way
  transaction costs. The repository does not claim live trading profit
  and loss.
